Hi Chi,

The "--minOverlap" option works on both reads and features, namely it gives the minimum number of bases overlapping between the feature and the read, hence there isn't a "--minOverlapFeature" option.

The best value of it depends on the data in your analysis, say, what are the reads (WGS? Total RNA Sequencing?), how similar the sequences are in the transposable element database, what is the sequencing quality and how did you map the reads, etc.

Cheers,
Yang

